		{
			"id": 200803,
			"completionStepIds": [
				200806
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_AUTO",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"200806",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 200806,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Kamisato Ayaka"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 20080301,
					"content": "How strange... It's never this quiet here.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080302,
					"content": "Woof, woof... woof!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Taroumaru"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080303,
					"content": "Thoma's playing his ventriloquist game again, huh?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080304,
					"content": "Thoma... Thoma...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080305,
					"content": "Woof! Woof! ...Woof!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Taroumaru"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080306,
					"content": "Hey, you can come out now... Paimon's seen you already...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080307,
					"content": "Huh, not a peep... Ugh, so where the heck is he, then?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080308,
					"content": "Woof, woof, woof! Woof!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Taroumaru"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080309,
					"content": "Huh? What's got Taroumaru so worked up today? He's always such a good boy...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080310,
					"content": "Hello, have either of you seen Thoma?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kamisato Ayaka"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080311,
					"content": "No, we thought he'd be with you! Why, has something happened?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080312,
					"content": "Then it's as I feared... On the way here, I heard that Thoma had been taken away by the Tenryou Commission.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kamisato Ayaka"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080313,
					"content": "I wasn't certain whether it was true, so I came right here. The fact that he hasn't arrived here as we arranged suggests that it is true.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kamisato Ayaka"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080314,
					"content": "The Raiden Shogun is holding a Vision Hunt Ceremony at the Statue of the Omnipresent God today, to mark the 100th Vision seized under the decree.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kamisato Ayaka"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080315,
					"content": "And the 100th Vision bearer in question... the one who will have their Vision seized, I fear... is Thoma.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kamisato Ayaka"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080316,
					"content": "Hold up a second... So the ceremony that Thoma said the Tenryou Commission were busy preparing for... that was this Vision Hunt Ceremony? And he was the target all along?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080317,
					"content": "...I believe so. The shogun and the Tenryou Commission see the ceremony as a milestone. With the 100th Vision, they wish to mark the success of the Vision Hunt Decree to date.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kamisato Ayaka"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080318,
					"content": "...This cannot happen. I must go and rescue him!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kamisato Ayaka"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080319,
					"content": "Woof, woof! Woof!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Taroumaru"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080320,
					"content": "Stay calm.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080321
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 20080321,
					"content": "But you are the Shirasagi Himegimi.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080322
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 20080322,
					"content": "Yeah! Like it or not, you represent the whole Yashiro Commission. So if you go and pull a stunt like that, you're basically declaring you and the Raiden Shogun are enemies now, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080323,
					"content": "And by doing it so publicly, you might be implicating a lot of other people from the Yashiro Commission, too...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080324,
					"content": "There is no other option... I must act with haste — the ceremony is about to begin. I will not abandon Thoma like this.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kamisato Ayaka"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080325,
					"content": "He is my friend! To think that not long ago, we were... all eating hotpot together...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kamisato Ayaka"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080326,
					"content": "He is my friend, too. I will save him.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080327
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 20080327,
					"content": "But...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080328
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kamisato Ayaka"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080328,
					"content": "You said it yourself. No time to delay.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080329
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 20080329,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080330
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kamisato Ayaka"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080330,
					"content": "...Okay, I'll... wait here for your return. Get back safely.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080331
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kamisato Ayaka"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080331,
					"content": "Don't worry, Ayaka. A friend's life is on the line — we ain't about to mess this up!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
